@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Mixed MVP / future. Retained broader-product associations require explicit future node labels; MVP uses only core/basic ProjectForge.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — delivery reconciliation before coding
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Current requirements + analysis/design + remaining gates" as Inputs
rectangle "Reviewable work outcomes + dependencies + full effort ranges\nInclude learning/docs/testing/recovery/operations/rework" as Work
rectangle "Compare to 20 total project hours/week\nActual availability/progress and dependency delays\nRequested date remains a request" as Forecast
rectangle "Inspect/reconcile actual live issues/board\nSelect first ready Sprint Goal / items / plan" as Tracking
rectangle "Complete agreed initial SDLC documentation/design\nActual pre-implementation baseline decision before coding" as Baseline #DFF1EA
Inputs --> Work
Work --> Forecast
Forecast --> Tracking
Tracking --> Baseline
note bottom of Forecast
No hours, throughput or accepted delivery date estimated here.
Do not fix all future Sprints or silently reduce agreed scope.
A coherent commit records change; it is not acceptance by itself.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
